function selectionHTML(){const f=C.selectedFeature();let html=O.selectionHTML();if(!f)return html;html+=C.section('Object control')+B(f.properties.locked?'Unlock object':'Lock object','toggleSelectedLock')+B('Bring to front','frontSelected')+B('Send to back','backSelected');if(f.properties.type==='accessPoint')html+=B('Edit entrance & address','editAccess');if(f.properties.routeId&&['lion','hybrid','tuff'].includes(f.properties.product)){const p=PRODUCTS[f.properties.product];html+=B('Rebuild '+p.name+' run · '+p.width+' / '+(p.width*2)+' m wide','rebuildLion');}return html;}
